 <div id="voice-fields">${voiceFieldsHTML(d)}</div>
 <p class="small">${T('Simpan memakai penyimpanan daftar lama dan sinkronisasi server. Ini bukan penulisan pengalaman Supabase.','Saving uses the existing listing store and server sync. Supabase experience writes are not integrated.')}</p>
